# Development Branch

This is the dev branch containing all AWS Service Monitor code and infrastructure.

## Branch Information
- Contains: Full application code, tests, documentation
- Purpose: Development and staging work
- Target for PRs: Pull requests from dev to main restore code

## Files Included
- Terraform infrastructure configuration
- Lambda function with service monitoring logic
- DynamoDB registry for state management
- Comprehensive test suite (12 unit tests + integration tests)
- Complete documentation

To merge to main, create a PR from this branch.

